# Always push PWA and iOS equally

After changes to either client — web PWA (`src/`, Worker config, `wrangler`, deploy workflow, public assets, etc.) or native iOS (`ios/`):

1. **Commit** the relevant files (do not wait to be asked).
2. **Push to `origin/main`** so both PWA (via GitHub Actions deploy) and iOS code stay in sync and up to date on origin.
3. Mention the live URL briefly when web changes are included (Workers / fordays.app as configured).

Keep PWA and iOS equally updated on `origin/main`.

Never include `BACKLOG.md` in a commit or push. Local only.
